# The secret level, E1M9, in a deathmatch of one player that the timer
# ends: the way back from it (the next level is E1M4), and the splat of
# the secret level on the map.
2250 press space        # goes on to the map
2300 shot map.ppm
2460 press space        # starts E1M4
2600 shot e1m4.ppm
2650 quit
